.DS_Store
.Rhistory

# generated outputs from process GFISHER data.R (maps/ was moved under output/)
output/maps/GFISHER/
output/maps/5min/
output/maps/15min/

# generated habitat-affinity outputs (scheme-tagged, e.g. affinity_selratio_mice/)
output/affinity_selratio*/

# NOT ignored, deliberately: output/basemaps/5min/ holds the sum-to-1 habitat layers that
# feed Ecospace and is a VERSIONED DELIVERABLE. Stage 1 of the driver overwrites it in place,
# so changes there should show up in git diff. Do not add a blanket output/ rule above this.
!output/basemaps/5min/

# large local-only inputs (user supplies their own copy of the geodatabase)
data/*.gdb/
data/**/*.gdb/
data/April2026/

# generated species -> model-group lookup (written by fn.make_gfisher_videodataset;
# scheme-tagged, e.g. GFISHER_species_fg_modnum_mice.csv)
data/GFISHER_species_fg*.csv

# author scratch
hoard/
prompt.md
.Rproj.user
